### Get one project by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Patch one project
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nouveau nom de projet",
  "description": "Un projet simple",
  "isArchived": true,
  "budget": {
    "amount": 1200,
    "limitCriteria": 67
  }
}